# Build context exclusions. This file MUST live at the repo root: every image
# here builds from the root (they are uv workspace members), and Docker reads
# .dockerignore only at the context root. ui/.dockerignore predates this and
# never applied, which is why `COPY ui/ ./` shipped 817MB of node_modules.

# Virtualenvs and node_modules: host-native binaries, wrong platform in-image,
# and `COPY ui/ ./` would land them on top of the install the build just ran.
.venv
**/.venv
**/node_modules

.git
.github
.githooks

# Tool caches
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.mypy_cache
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Next.js build output. The image runs `pnpm build` itself; a host copy here
# only masks whether that step works.
ui/.next
ui/out

# Test artifacts
ui/playwright
ui/playwright-report
ui/test-results
**/.DS_Store
**/*-debug.log*

# Coverage
.coverage
coverage*.xml
htmlcov

# Secrets must never enter a layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

dist
docs
# Every example except google_adk_plugin, which is the executor image's source.
# Listed one by one rather than `examples` with a `!` exception: buildkit walks
# a re-included subdirectory out of order and refuses the context outright.
# The example's own secrets are excluded below; `**/.venv` keeps its virtualenv
# out already.
examples/README.md
examples/agent_control_demo
examples/cisco_ai_defense
examples/crewai
examples/customer_support_agent
examples/deepeval
examples/galileo_luna
examples/google_adk_callbacks
examples/google_adk_decorator
examples/langchain
examples/steer_action_demo
examples/strands_agents
examples/target_context_demo
examples/typescript_sdk
examples/google_adk_plugin/.env
examples/google_adk_plugin/.env.*
